      "content": "Wait, you said pathways to citizenship is the \"only\" sustainable way. But doesn't focusing on humanitarian processing and pathways actually undermine the rule of law and create more of an \"incentive\" for illegal crossings? Some analysts argue that without the security/enforcement side being the primary pillar, you're just inviting more chaos and social instability.",
